arkf200000ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;p-nYnPzTkB5gVMruCo5AFrewzt4eELIluwO19YcPYjMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarki0.3166947ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;DyMmbnHaokuNH6xjGTiLHKJlrqmVdrJhA0kmdANP9z8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka4ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;6GVX3P2V9bjWjhtwQBC9JleQtstdSWbMJEhUk8VvMYYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarke32000ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;HCSMz5m5LyQ9ggKXq8ncIqL3kG37TMwQZoqqz82WO-4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd9525ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QWi-J38AVdBudpoaAPOjJnVEgpXUM1LeII7fIq2wHwwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;G97ymxuHbavD4fU3GwHmNJzHuICG3QF47U3sIR42LpYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka4ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;7sE9Nq3n8DiM-CY2sv_5SLkFBRRRyJZoYBOZAs-pZ84ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;2gx5mzU6XGaTsXs0QgaS9-9NOfudoy-ZQVyMJHMZusAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyé{"tool":"submit_revision_request","failureLayer":"writer-model","replayFrom":"Rewrite section 3 to synthesize rather than restate the lede and sections 1â€“2.","summary":"The manuscript is well-sourced and attributed through two sections but collapses in its third section into circular restatement of the lede and earlier body. All material claims in sections 1â€“2 are traceable to witnessed evidence. The closing section adds no new synthesis, evidence, or significance. One bounded repair to the third section is sufficient; the rest of the manuscript is publishable.","requiredRepairs":["Rewrite section 3 to advance the piece beyond what sections 1â€“2 already establish. The opening paragraph restates the lede in substance. The closing paragraph ('The economics discipline that has governed... makes the timeline for that reckoning something the volume's arrival makes newly unavoidable') is padded circular abstraction adding no claim, evidence, or synthesis not already delivered. Replace with genuine forward synthesis grounded in witnessed sources."],"report":"## Editorial Assessment â€” economics-and-the-biophysical-limits-to-growth-a-new\n\n### Deterministic Standards\n\nThe deterministic gate returns `publishable: true` with one warning (`demand-lens-missing-h2`): a level-two heading should naturally signal the demand lens when reporting supports it. The Jevons paradox material in section 2 is the natural home for this signal, but the heading \"The Ecomodernist Premise and Its Discontents\" does not surface it. This is advisory and non-blocking at the gate level; I note it for the writer but do not make it a required repair, since the content is fully present and attributed.\n\n### Source Inventory and Claim Audit\n\nTwo sources are referenced in the manuscript and witnessed in the research packet:\n\n**[1] Winne van Woerden, \"Green growth,\" Uneven Earth, Oct 31 2022 (unevenearth.org)**\n\nThis is the primary evidentiary source. All of the following manuscript claims are traceable to its witnessed summary:\n- Green growth is the governing assumption in the European Green Deal, Paris Agreement, IPCC reports, and the US Inflation Reduction Act â€” **supported**\n- The ecomodernist premise: \"there are no limits to growth since there are no limits to human ingenuity\" â€” **supported** (direct quote from source)\n- The distinction between relative and absolute decoupling, and Van Woerden's argument that absolute decoupling is empirically unsupported â€” **supported**\n- The Jevons paradox framing: efficiency gains absorbed by expanded consumption rather than banked as ecological savings â€” **supported**\n- \"Carbon tunnel\" thinking: green growth frameworks address atmospheric carbon while ignoring broader interacting planetary systems â€” **supported**; source specifically references \"nine natural systems\" and climate tipping points\n- Green growth characterized as \"dangerously misguided\" â€” **supported** (source's own phrasing)\n\nAttribution is consistently visible throughout sections 1 and 2. Van Woerden and Uneven Earth are named on first reference and maintained as attribution. No source claim has been upgraded from \"alleges\" to newsroom fact without appropriate framing.\n\n**[2] \"23 Responses to Economics' Biggest-ever Question,\" rwer.wordpress.com, Jul 14 2026**\n\n- Title and editors (Edward Fullbrook and Jamie Morgan) â€” **supported**\n- Subtitle \"Economics and the Biophysical Limits to Economic Growth\" â€” **supported** (source summary: \"Economicsandthe Biophysical Limits to Economic Growth Edited by Edward Fullbrook and Jamie Morgan\")\n- \"For over a century economics has loosely guided the global economy's national economies\" â€” **supported** (near-verbatim from source)\n- Climate crisis \"caused by the global economy\" and \"now in an accelerating phase\" that \"threatens its existence\" â€” **supported**\n- \"The collection arrived this month\" â€” publication date July 14, 2026; editorial date July 19, 2026 â€” **supported**\n\nThe manuscript does not import claims from the two unselected sources (resilience.org; solar.lowtechmagazine.com), which is correct.\n\n### Headline and Lede Fidelity\n\nHeadline and lede are faithful to the witnessed material. The subtitle of the collection is accurately rendered. The lede does not overstate modality or scope.\n\n### Prose Quality: Sections 1â€“2\n\nSections 1 and 2 are specific, attributed, and non-redundant. Section 1 establishes policy stakes by grounding green growth's institutional footprint in Van Woerden's documented evidence. Section 2 unpacks three substantive critiques (decoupling, Jevons paradox, carbon tunnel) with concrete detail and visible attribution. The writing is disciplined and does not pad.\n\n### Prose Quality: Section 3 â€” Material Defect\n\nSection 3 (\"What the Volume's Arrival Puts on the Table\") fails the non-repetitive and non-abstraction standards.\n\nParagraph 1 restates the lede in substance: the collection arrived, its framing states economics guided the global economy for a century, the crisis is accelerating, and it threatens the economy. All of this was the lede's job and has already been delivered.\n\nParagraph 2 is the more serious defect:\n\n> \"Van Woerden's documented case â€” that the decoupling premise underpinning the green growth consensus does not withstand scrutiny â€” maps the contested terrain the collection enters. The economics discipline that has governed global economic decisions for a century is now being asked, by a volume assembling 23 responses to what its editors call economics' biggest-ever question, to reckon with whether the framework guiding that governance has the biophysical foundations it has claimed. The accelerating phase of the crisis the natural sciences describe makes the timeline for that reckoning something the volume's arrival makes newly unavoidable.\"\n\nThis adds zero new evidence, zero new synthesis, and zero new significance. It restates at increasing abstraction what sections 1 and 2 established concretely. The final sentence is a circular clause that says only that the situation is urgent because it is urgent. This is confident abstraction substituting for analysis.\n\nThe section's job â€” typical of a synthesizing close â€” would be to draw out what the collection's arrival means: what 23 scholarly responses represent as a disciplinary event, what the contested terrain implies for policy architecture, or what the limits-to-growth debate looks like from here. None of that work is done.\n\n### Pipeline Diagnosis\n\nSources are adequate. Assignment is valid. Instruction set is workable. Sections 1 and 2 demonstrate the writer model executed well on the evidentiary material. The failure is localized to the closing section, where abstract recapitulation substituted for forward synthesis. This is a writer-model execution defect, not a source or assignment failure. The repair is bounded: rewrite section 3 to advance the piece with genuine synthesis grounded in the witnessed material, eliminating the circular closing paragraph. No other section requires revision."}ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;2zMdimUrTxTb9pwz4YRIoJ75BTtn7o7sfWjfG7LqVrQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx$d861608d-54ad-48f5-897f-6325d6ed95f7ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ZatniFqQK-POziIhAs7LYFUrq0TWYOEasWHZPLIfmFUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkhtool_useƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;-gbWdTHHW5yD6YyN7T1lKuEwWlRT8XUXPR6vTuLEwI0ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;l0XW3sFYFcTM3d6p8vSBD5XJr45OYh1d_dETAf2Q77oƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarklwriter-modelƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;78QtxfVD05lJsd8qKbrtVAr9n85_tqe3pswNh1I9iMkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxPRewrite section 3 to synthesize rather than restate the lede and sections 1â€“2.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;rIVfulXO4RbxYw0E7E9ug0sHis9ARIj9ZS42ZfIQv8kƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky\## Editorial Assessment â€” economics-and-the-biophysical-limits-to-growth-a-new

### Deterministic Standards

The deterministic gate returns `publishable: true` with one warning (`demand-lens-missing-h2`): a level-two heading should naturally signal the demand lens when reporting supports it. The Jevons paradox material in section 2 is the natural home for this signal, but the heading "The Ecomodernist Premise and Its Discontents" does not surface it. This is advisory and non-blocking at the gate level; I note it for the writer but do not make it a required repair, since the content is fully present and attributed.

### Source Inventory and Claim Audit

Two sources are referenced in the manuscript and witnessed in the research packet:

**[1] Winne van Woerden, "Green growth," Uneven Earth, Oct 31 2022 (unevenearth.org)**

This is the primary evidentiary source. All of the following manuscript claims are traceable to its witnessed summary:
- Green growth is the governing assumption in the European Green Deal, Paris Agreement, IPCC reports, and the US Inflation Reduction Act â€” **supported**
- The ecomodernist premise: "there are no limits to growth since there are no limits to human ingenuity" â€” **supported** (direct quote from source)
- The distinction between relative and absolute decoupling, and Van Woerden's argument that absolute decoupling is empirically unsupported â€” **supported**
- The Jevons paradox framing: efficiency gains absorbed by expanded consumption rather than banked as ecological savings â€” **supported**
- "Carbon tunnel" thinking: green growth frameworks address atmospheric carbon while ignoring broader interacting planetary systems â€” **supported**; source specifically references "nine natural systems" and climate tipping points
- Green growth characterized as "dangerously misguided" â€” **supported** (source's own phrasing)

Attribution is consistently visible throughout sections 1 and 2. Van Woerden and Uneven Earth are named on first reference and maintained as attribution. No source claim has been upgraded from "alleges" to newsroom fact without appropriate framing.

**[2] "23 Responses to Economics' Biggest-ever Question," rwer.wordpress.com, Jul 14 2026**

- Title and editors (Edward Fullbrook and Jamie Morgan) â€” **supported**
- Subtitle "Economics and the Biophysical Limits to Economic Growth" â€” **supported** (source summary: "Economicsandthe Biophysical Limits to Economic Growth Edited by Edward Fullbrook and Jamie Morgan")
- "For over a century economics has loosely guided the global economy's national economies" â€” **supported** (near-verbatim from source)
- Climate crisis "caused by the global economy" and "now in an accelerating phase" that "threatens its existence" â€” **supported**
- "The collection arrived this month" â€” publication date July 14, 2026; editorial date July 19, 2026 â€” **supported**

The manuscript does not import claims from the two unselected sources (resilience.org; solar.lowtechmagazine.com), which is correct.

### Headline and Lede Fidelity

Headline and lede are faithful to the witnessed material. The subtitle of the collection is accurately rendered. The lede does not overstate modality or scope.

### Prose Quality: Sections 1â€“2

Sections 1 and 2 are specific, attributed, and non-redundant. Section 1 establishes policy stakes by grounding green growth's institutional footprint in Van Woerden's documented evidence. Section 2 unpacks three substantive critiques (decoupling, Jevons paradox, carbon tunnel) with concrete detail and visible attribution. The writing is disciplined and does not pad.

### Prose Quality: Section 3 â€” Material Defect

Section 3 ("What the Volume's Arrival Puts on the Table") fails the non-repetitive and non-abstraction standards.

Paragraph 1 restates the lede in substance: the collection arrived, its framing states economics guided the global economy for a century, the crisis is accelerating, and it threatens the economy. All of this was the lede's job and has already been delivered.

Paragraph 2 is the more serious defect:

> "Van Woerden's documented case â€” that the decoupling premise underpinning the green growth consensus does not withstand scrutiny â€” maps the contested terrain the collection enters. The economics discipline that has governed global economic decisions for a century is now being asked, by a volume assembling 23 responses to what its editors call economics' biggest-ever question, to reckon with whether the framework guiding that governance has the biophysical foundations it has claimed. The accelerating phase of the crisis the natural sciences describe makes the timeline for that reckoning something the volume's arrival makes newly unavoidable."

This adds zero new evidence, zero new synthesis, and zero new significance. It restates at increasing abstraction what sections 1 and 2 established concretely. The final sentence is a circular clause that says only that the situation is urgent because it is urgent. This is confident abstraction substituting for analysis.

The section's job â€” typical of a synthesizing close â€” would be to draw out what the collection's arrival means: what 23 scholarly responses represent as a disciplinary event, what the contested terrain implies for policy architecture, or what the limits-to-growth debate looks like from here. None of that work is done.

### Pipeline Diagnosis

Sources are adequate. Assignment is valid. Instruction set is workable. Sections 1 and 2 demonstrate the writer model executed well on the evidentiary material. The failure is localized to the closing section, where abstract recapitulation substituted for forward synthesis. This is a writer-model execution defect, not a source or assignment failure. The repair is bounded: rewrite section 3 to advance the piece with genuine synthesis grounded in the witnessed material, eliminating the circular closing paragraph. No other section requires revision.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;oWVLYXGh-trpXU3dWlwpHA7cuzTtmaV_iX-Fg3tTmJQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;NSw-QWsSFYqtGvRBsIrcS0vIyBtSa0f2-4zcg8-iAwIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyÓRewrite section 3 to advance the piece beyond what sections 1â€“2 already establish. The opening paragraph restates the lede in substance. The closing paragraph ('The economics discipline that has governed... makes the timeline for that reckoning something the volume's arrival makes newly unavoidable') is padded circular abstraction adding no claim, evidence, or synthesis not already delivered. Replace with genuine forward synthesis grounded in witnessed sources.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QIs4W4SymxUxsnYZr81b3zvyiCXcecYHkeTewTtfbA0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyThe manuscript is well-sourced and attributed through two sections but collapses in its third section into circular restatement of the lede and earlier body. All material claims in sections 1â€“2 are traceable to witnessed evidence. The closing section adds no new synthesis, evidence, or significance. One bounded repair to the third section is sufficient; the rest of the manuscript is publisha